# PATCH-06 verification log — Secure SSH (SEC-P1-007)

- Run: 20261003-0018-develop-a72b8cc
- Repo: chat (MaineCyberTech), base: origin/develop @ a72b8cc43590848b052bd5e8954dbbc726b3d7fd
- Branch: remediation/patch-06-20261003-0018-develop-a72b8cc
- Runner: Proxmox ci-runner (LXC 200) via lab job API (tools/lab_runner.py); working tree synced with scripts/lab-sync.ps1
- Generated: 2026-10-03 (pre-commit verification)
- Findings: SEC-P1-007
- Changed files: infra/terraform/variables.tf, .github/workflows/deploy-production.yml, .github/workflows/infra-development.yml

Root cause confirmed from git history: `a72b8cc` removed `TF_VAR_ssh_allowed_ips` from the
Terraform Apply step of `.github/workflows/infra-development.yml`; the `ssh_allowed_ips`
variable still defaulted to `0.0.0.0/0` in `infra/terraform/variables.tf`, so both provision
workflows fell back to an internet-open SSH rule.

